      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "100cbc07c7bab8239d9fdaa80bff95c16e3744d6df094fb9d2e5bbccd974707b",
      "text": "Spend the day at leisure or choose one of the optional excursions according to the interests of adults and children.\n\n**Rio de Janeiro Botanical Garden**\n\n**Duration:** 4 hours.\n\n**Maracanã Stadium Tour**\n\n**Duration:** 4 hours.\n\n**Royal Petrópolis — an excursion from Rio de Janeiro**\n\n**Duration:** 8 hours.\n\n**Tropical Islands: Boat Trip from Itacuruçá**\n\nSpend a full day travelling from bustling Rio towards the Costa Verde coast.\n\n**Duration:** 8 hours.\n\n**Rio de Janeiro — Mulatas Show**\n\nAvailable on request.\n\n**Duration:** 4 hours.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
